{"t":"Krunus","s":"krunus-06384","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>Krunus is one of the gods worshipped by the tribeman of <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>. He is presumably the same entity as the Thaian god Crunor. According to <a href=\"#/wiki/Ulala\">Ulala</a>:<br/> </p><div class=\"NPCQuote messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"npc\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ulala\">Ulala</a></span>: <span class=\"msg\">Krunus is God for plants and birth. He hidden in all that grows.</span><br/></div><p><br/>\n</p><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"32pxd\"><img alt=\"32pxd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><figcaption>32pxd</figcaption></figure><p><i>This  article is a stub. You can help TibiaWiki by expanding it.</i></p></div></div>","quests":["unnatural-selection-quest"]}